            "text": "The CSSOM/CDP comparison is an authentication boundary, not a visual tolerance. Both ordered channels are reduced only to Blink's native 1/64 CSS-pixel LayoutUnit representation; any count, order, or coordinate disagreement leaves the record unavailable before vector paint.",
            "markdown": "The CSSOM/CDP comparison is an authentication boundary, not a visual tolerance. Both ordered channels are reduced only to Blink's native 1/64 CSS-pixel LayoutUnit representation; any count, order, or coordinate disagreement leaves the record unavailable before vector paint."
          },
